==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[absolute]] [[value]]}}

# {{mathematics}} For a [[real number]], its [[numerical]] value without [[regard]] to its [[sign]]; formally, -1 times the number if the number is negative, and the number unmodified if it is zero or positive.
# {{mathematics}} For a [[complex number]], the [[square root]] of the [[sum]] of the [[square]]s of its [[real]] and [[imaginary]] parts.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|square root}} [[modulus]].

====Hypernyms====
* [[Euclidean norm]]
** [[norm]]

====Derived terms====
* [[p-adic absolute value|''p''-adic absolute value]]
* [[trivial absolute value]]

